               (JSON/JS/Python/C/shell)                 [BUILD] rel=medium
    [ ] 15.2.  \uXXXX / \xNN unicode-escape <-> text    [BUILD] rel=medium
    [ ] 15.3.  code point <-> char; UTF-8 / UTF-16
